## Files created

scheme/swift/stable/remangler.go
  - Public entry point: Remangle(ctx, tree, opts) *Result, error
  - Internal struct: remangler{buf strings.Builder, scheme string}
  - Mangle(ctx, tree, opts) method on Scheme{} — wires into demangle.Mangler interface
  - remangleNode dispatcher switching on common.NodeKind
  - Fully implemented: KindGlobal, KindModule, KindIdentifier, KindType,
    KindStructure, KindClass, KindEnum, KindProtocol
  - All other kinds: ErrUnsupported

