## Known gaps (stubs with ErrUnsupported)

- Word-substitution within identifiers (the "0<letter>..." encoding in
  ManglingUtils.h mangleIdentifier). Only the simple length-prefix path
  is implemented. Multi-word identifiers like "SwiftUI" that would benefit
  from word-reuse will still encode correctly but without compression.
- Punycode / non-ASCII identifiers (the "00<punycodeLen><bytes>" path).
- Node-level back-substitutions (A0_, A1_, ... in demangle input).
- All other NodeKind values not listed in the "Fully implemented" section:
  KindBoundGenericStructure, KindBoundGenericClass, KindBoundGenericEnum,
  KindBoundGenericProtocol, KindFunction, KindFunctionType, KindBuiltinTypeName,
  KindBuiltinInt, KindBuiltinFloat, KindBuiltinVector, KindTypeList,
  KindArgumentTuple, KindReturnType, KindTuple, KindTupleElement,
  KindMetatype, KindExistentialMetatype, KindDependentGenericParamType,
  KindDependentGenericType, KindFunctionEntity, KindEntityPath,
  KindLabelList, KindEmptyList, KindStandardSubstitution, KindPrivateDeclName,
  KindSuffix, KindTypeMangling, KindInvalid.
- MangleFidelity remains demangle.None in the Info var (flip to Exact once
  the full grammar is covered and round-trip proven).
